 Details Bookmark Financial Program Assistant CSA02818P SDSU-Facilities & Services-Customer Service Ctr CSA 09/18/2026 South Dakota State University’s Facilities & Services Department is seeking a Financial Program Assistant to support essential financial and operational services across campus. This multifaceted role combines accounts payable, purchasing, mail services, and warehouse support, making it an excellent opportunity for an organized and detail-oriented professional looking to make a campus-wide i... View Details Bookmark Custodial Services Supervisor I CSA02609P SDSU-University Housing CSA 09/17/2026 South Dakota State University (SDSU) Student Life Building Services is looking for a motivated individual to join our team as a Custodial Services Supervisor within University Housing and Residential Life.This position is located in Brookings.Must be authorized to work in the U.S. Sponsorship is not available for this position.Job Responsibilities:This position plans, coordinates and directs th... View Details Bookmark HR Program Assistant II CSA02816P SDSU-Human Resources CSA 09/23/2026 South Dakota State University (SDState) is actively seeking a highly dedicated, people-centered Human Resource professional to join our team! Be a part of a dynamic team and provide exceptional customer service to the campus community. We are hiring for four HR Program Assistant II positions.  This position is located in Brookings, South Dakota.  Must be authorized to work in the U.S.  Sponsors... View Details Bookmark Information Specialist CSA02815P SDSU- Animal Science CSA 09/18/2026 South Dakota State University (SDState) is currently seeking an Information Specialist to join our Animal Science department. This position will play a critical role in the department’s three primary missions which are learning, discovery, and engagement. If you have a strong attention to detail and excellent writing, editing and proofreading skills then this position may be for you!Tomorrow’s