efficiency with minimal environme... View Details Bookmark Family & Community Health Educator CSA02810P SDSU-Food & Families Programs-Ext CSA 09/21/2026 South Dakota State University (SDState) is seeking multiple Family & Community Health Educators. These positions improve the health and well-being of South Dakotans by delivering evidence-based health education programs, supporting behavior change, and connecting individuals with resources that promote healthy lifestyles and chronic disease self-management. This position is grant funded, co... View Details Bookmark Facility Worker CSA02809P SDSU-Facilities & Services-Custodial Svc CSA 09/14/2026 SDSU Facilities & Services is in search of motivated and dependable individuals to join our cleaning team as Facility Workers. No prior professional cleaning experience is needed. You bring your willingness to learn, and we will equip you with all the training and tools to complete the job. This position is located in Brookings, South Dakota. Must be authorized to work in the U.S.  Sponsors... View Details Bookmark Plumbing Specialist CSA02807P SDSU-Facilities & Services-Bldg Maint CSA South Dakota State University is seeking a Plumbing Specialist to help keep our campus running strong. We’re looking for someone who takes pride in craftsmanship and problem-solving. In this role, you’ll tackle a wide range of plumbing projects that help maintain safe, reliable facilities. We provide the tools and support to help you do your best work and continue growing in your trade. This po... View Details Bookmark Database Systems Engineer CSA02806P SDSU-IT Systems Administration CSA 09/13/2026 SDState is seeking a skilled System Engineer specializing Microsoft Cloud Offerings (Azure, Intune, Microsoft 365, Entra) to join its IT Systems Administration Department. This role is ideal for well-organized, self-motivated team players who want to contribute to the Office of Information Technology’s (OIT) mission of providing technology, skills,