urces, programming, and support via learning communities while building relationships with stakeholder groups to support the vision of... View Details Bookmark Controller NFE03119P SDSU-Accounting Office-Controller NFE South Dakota State University (SDSU) is seeking a driven and visionary Controller to join the Accounting Department in a vital leadership role. This position not only offers the opportunity to make a significant impact on the university’s financial strategy but also provides a clear pathway for professional growth and further leadership opportunities within our dynamic team. This position is lo... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director for Housing Services and Operations NFE03146P SDSU-University Housing NFE South Dakota State University (SDState) is seeking an Assistant Director for Housing Services and Operations in Housing and Residential Life. This position will provide oversight and strategic direction for a broad portfolio for residential operations, including summer camps and conference housing, apartment contracting and occupancy management, residential communications and marketing, front d... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Residential Life for Community and Connection NFE03145P SDSU-University Housing NFE South Dakota State University (SDState) is seeking an Assistant Director of Residential Life for Community and Connection in Housing and Residential Life. This position will provide collaborative leadership that advances Housing and Residential Life’s mission by cultivating environments where student communities, connection, and belonging are central to the residential experience and on campus ... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director of Residential Life for Student Success NFE03144P SDSU-University Housing NFE South Dakota State University (SDState) is seeking an Assistant Director of Residential Life for Student Success in Housing and Residential Life. This position will provide collaborative leadership that advances Housing and Residential Life’s mission by cultivating environments where student communities, academic success, and belonging are central to the residential experience and on campus exp... View Details Bookmark Mechanical Engineer NFE03112P SDSU-Facilities & Services-Energy Systems NFE South Dakota State University (SDState) – Facilities & Services is looking for a Mechanical Engineer to support the operation, maintenance, and repair of the Animal Resource Wing (ARW) and other campus buildings. In this role, you’ll manage facility maintenance, oversee repairs and alterations, and contribute to mechanical project planning and design across campus. This position will help e... View Details Bookmark The South Dakota Board of Regents is an Equal Opportunity Employer. The Board of Regents will take Affirmative Action to ensure that all employment practices are free of discrimination. In addition, the Board of Regents fully supports incorporation of non-discrimination and Affirmative Action rules and regulations into all of its employment practices. Arrangements for accommodations required by disabilities can be made by contacting the appropriate Human Resources office. Please see the Contact Us section of this webpage for more information. Veterans’ & Disability Preference/Re-employment Rights Campus Security & Crime Statistics Clery Report Position Definitions Notice to all applicants: If you are selected as a finalist, job references and a background check may be conducted. South Dakota Board of Regents 306 E. Capital Ave, Suite 200 Pierre, SD 57501 605-773-3455 Back to top Copyright © Faber To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
